QuestGuidance.Register("en",274,{
[8737]="7005985C\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Enemies at the East-gate'\tYour mission is to defeat the Pûlpum gate-captain and Orcs camped at the East-gate of Moria. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8738]="700583EB\n1\tDefeat Gundabad siege-trolls in Ashmâr-zarakh (total: 3)\tYour mission is to defeat the siege-trolls of Ashmâr-zarakh.\n",
[8739]="70058422\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Engines of Flesh and Stone'\tYour mission is to defeat the siege-trolls of Ashmâr-zarakh. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Ashmâr-zarakh.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8740]="70070CD3\n1\tComplete Mission: Enough Problems Already\tYour mission is to travel to Mokh Grazádh to the west and thin the number of Orcs in the camp before they continue to attack Laivárth. If you can, destroy any supplies you come across as well. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully thinned the numbers within the Orc's ranks and hurt their supplies. That should ensure that Laivárth is safe for now.\n",
[8741]="70071DFC\n1\tComplete Mission: Escape from the Palace\tYour mission is travel to the Hall of Lajór in Zajâna and free the nobles taken prisoner by the Jewelled Council. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have freed the Zajâni nobles and gotten them safely out of the Hall of Lajór. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8742]="70071DF8\n1\tComplete Mission: Everything Goes Boom\tYour mission is journey to Glúkroz and defeat the goblins encamped there and set fire to their weapons of war. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have defeated the goblin war-leader and destroyed their weapons of war. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8743]="7006D1C4\n1\tComplete Mission: Eviction Notice\tYour mission is to clear the Ordâkhai from their camp north of Iridír. You should defeat the Ordâkhai and burn their tents. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to get started.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have defeated the Ordâkhai, burned their tents, and bested their champion. Return with Khâdamul to report your success.\n",
[8744]="7005894D\n1\tClaim the path to Grálinvarth\tYour mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade.\n2\tClaim the Ford of Greylin\tYour mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade.\n3\tClaim the high-falls of Greylin\tYour mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade.\n4\tClaim Grálinvarth\tYour mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade.\n",
[8745]="70058969\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Eyes on Elderslade'\tYour mission is to secure Grálinvarth as a foothold for the Gabil'akkâ in Elderslade. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Grálinvarth.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8746]="7006C12D\n1\tComplete Mission: Fashionable Thievery\tYour mission is to go to Ghât Okho and recover the helms the crebain so brazenly stole. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have successfully retrieved the headwear! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8747]="70072F7D\n1\tComplete Mission: Fell Summoning\tYour mission is to prevent the kergrim from befouling the Tombs of Khâb Ishil and using it as a conduit to summon fell spirits into the world! Find a way to disrupt the ritual and end this menace.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have prevented the kergrim from befouling the Tombs of Khâb Ishil, and stopped their ploy to summon fell spirits into the world!\n",
[8748]="70070CFF\n1\tComplete Mission: Flies in the Marsh\tYour mission is to travel to Saig Hathíl and thin the numbers of the sickle-flies there who have become dangerous and aggressive.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully thinned the numbers of sickle-flies in Saig Hathíl. It should be safe for travellers once again.\n",
[8749]="70062D12\n1\tComplete the Mission: Time to Feast\tOrdered by the taskmaster at Gramsfoot, you are to make your way to Hoarhallow and slaughter the Hobbits for food.\n2\tReturn to Uglash at Gramsfoot\tYou did a good slaughtering those filthy Hobbits. Now make your way back to Uglash and tell him of what you have done.\n",
[8750]="7005CACE\n1\tTend to injured Longbeards (total: 8)\030Defeat drakes (total: 10)\030Challenge the dwarves to renew their resolve! (total: 8)\tAssist the Longbeard Dwarves in defeating the frost-drake assault.\n2\tMake your way back down the mountain slope\tMake your way back down the mountain slope.\n",
[8751]="7005CAD0\n1\tComplete Mission: Frosty Reception\tYour mission is to defend Erebor from a Frost-horde assault. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8752]="700585AB\n1\tSneak up on the goblins\tSneak up on the goblins.\n2\tAssist the goblins with their drinking (total: 4)\030Distract goblins with a point (total: 2)\030Distract goblins with a wave bye (total: 2)\tDefeat the goblins at Stramvárth.\n3\tDefeat the goblin leader\tDefeat the goblin leader.\n4\tDance with the goblin leader\030Perform another dance with the goblin leader\030Perform second type of dance with the goblin leader\030Perform third type of dance with the goblin leader\tDance with the goblin leader.\n",
[8753]="700585B6\n1\tComplete Mission: Goblins at Stramvárth\tYour mission is to ambush a group of raiders camped at Stramvárth for the night. Speak to Hórin to travel to Stramvárth.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8754]="7005A817\n1\tEnter the vault\tEnter the vault.\n2\tCollect treasure (total: 20)\030Collect valuable treasure (total: 4)\030Collect priceless treasure (total: 2)\030Exit the vault after collecting the treasure!\tCollect the treasure and exit the vault before it closes shut! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
