[8763]="70062CDF\n1\tComplete the Mission: Haunting at Dol Ernil\tWithin the walls of Dol Ernil, the gaunt-men take residence where they should not be. It falls to you to enter the ruins and destroy the foe there.\n2\tTalk to Baglan\tYou have eliminated the enemy within the ruin. Now you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your victory.\n",
[8764]="7006D1AC\n1\tComplete Mission: Havoc in Eshadûr\tYour mission is to infiltrate Eshadûr and destroy their new supply of black powder. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to begin.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have destroyed the Ordâkhai's stock of black powder! Return with Khâdamul to report your success.\n",
